why: run 16 routed "apply this before the posting filter, so a book that keeps no posting is removed whole" to a test named for the ordering, and the interface then told its caller nothing of the order; Kirill: code and comments are understood without the reader jumping to tests, so a test is never a carrier and an ordering every caller owes stays at the site Rescored 2026-09-29 under §94: subject and phrasing keeps dropped, so its column no longer compares.
labelled: 2026-09-29
--- code
export interface BookNarrowing {
  keepsBook(book: PostingBook): boolean;
  keepsPosting(posting: Posting, book: PostingBook): boolean;
}
--- facts
Apply keepsBook before keepsPosting, so a book that keeps no posting is removed whole.
--- tests
// BookNarrowing.test.ts in the change set
it('should stop recognising such a book once its postings are gone, so books are dropped before them', () => {
  expect(narrowing.keepsBook(emptiedBook)).toBe(false);
});
